tered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":230082,"global_rank":109709},{"name":"pgooch/GamepediaViewer","owner":"pgooch","html_url":"https://github.com/pgooch/GamepediaViewer","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"View your always up-to-date Gamepedia collection view Dropbox syncing even when offline.","topics":[],"score":230080,"global_rank":109713},{"name":"anvaka/port-number","owner":"anvaka","html_url":"https://github.com/anvaka/port-number","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Returns a port number for your dev server based on file path","topics":[],"score":230072,"global_rank":109718},{"name":"DawsonG/OSMMVC","owner":"DawsonG","html_url":"https://github.com/DawsonG/OSMMVC","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"A super small, super light, routing magic plugin for creating MVC patterns in Node.js with Express.","topics":[],"score":230069,"global_rank":109723},{"name":"mccarthydev/coloredbalz","owner":"mccarthydev","html_url":"https://github.com/mccarthydev/coloredbalz","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"My first javascript game, you have 5 seconds to memorize the colors of the balls. Score more and more in each turn","topics":[],"score":230068,"global_rank":109730},{"name":"kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","owner":"kwokwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Created for UW iGEM 2018/Experimentation","topics":[],"score":230068,"global_rank":109731},{"nam